00:02:30.520 --> 00:02:32.570
You shouldn't do this!

00:02:32.570 --> 00:02:33.260
Shut up.

00:02:34.500 --> 00:02:37.430
What's with you, Hotori? Don't be such a goody two-shoes.

00:02:47.880 --> 00:02:49.690
Tadase-san.

00:02:49.690 --> 00:02:53.400
Wipe away those tears, Tadase-san.

00:02:57.220 --> 00:02:59.680
{SIGN ON WALL}Aspire

00:03:02.930 --> 00:03:04.500
What's wrong?

00:03:06.130 --> 00:03:08.240
I had a dream.

00:03:08.860 --> 00:03:13.500
A dream from before Grandmother became ill, when she was still healthy.

00:03:16.540 --> 00:03:18.260
I see.

00:03:19.830 --> 00:03:22.790
Grandmother, are you awake?

00:03:35.190 --> 00:03:36.390
I'm leaving now.

00:03:41.020 --> 00:03:44.510
When she was healthy, she was always up and about earlier than anyone.

00:03:44.510 --> 00:03:49.880
But now she doesn't even notice the flowers you bring her every morning.

00:03:55.530 --> 00:03:56.420
Stop!

00:03:56.800 --> 00:03:58.410
Twelve centimeters.

00:03:58.410 --> 00:04:00.390
Yay, it's a new record!

00:04:00.390 --> 00:04:03.180
I think even I could fit in her mouth!

00:04:03.180 --> 00:04:04.320
Hey!

00:04:04.860 --> 00:04:06.680
Amu-chan's yawn is big.

00:04:06.680 --> 00:04:11.140
Oh, be quiet! Anyway, it's because of you guys singing karaoke that I didn't sleep enough.

00:04:11.140 --> 00:04:14.530
So says the person who was having the most fun.

00:04:15.260 --> 00:04:16.780
Hinamori-san.

00:04:17.230 --> 00:04:18.440
Good morning.

00:04:18.440 --> 00:04:20.240
Tadase-kun!

00:04:20.240 --> 00:04:22.480
What's with the attitude change?

00:04:22.480 --> 00:04:25.080
I can hear her heart racing.

00:04:25.080 --> 00:04:26.980
Ba-dum, ba-dum!

00:04:26.980 --> 00:04:29.270
Ever the noisy bunch.

00:04:31.470 --> 00:04:33.440
What's the matter, Tadase-kun?

00:04:33.950 --> 00:04:35.050
Why do you ask?

00:04:35.050 --> 00:04:36.800
You seem kind of down.

00:04:37.140 --> 00:04:40.130
Really? I think I'm the same as always, though.

00:04:42.680 --> 00:04:45.470
6th Grade Star Class

00:04:43.540 --> 00:04:45.490
Hey, is that the infamous...

00:04:46.200 --> 00:04:48.140
Shh, you're talking too loud.

00:04:48.620 --> 00:04:51.270
We have to make sure to pass it on to someone else in seven days, okay?

00:04:51.270 --> 00:04:53.020
If we don't...

00:04:53.020 --> 00:04:54.940
Scary!

00:04:55.510 --> 00:04:58.300
A black CD? What's on it?

00:04:58.300 --> 00:04:59.030
Do you know?

00:04:59.030 --> 00:04:59.650
I don't.

00:04:59.940 --> 00:05:03.380
You two aren't into the latest fads, are you?

00:05:03.380 --> 00:05:06.030
"Hinamori Amu is a thickheaded girl."

00:05:06.550 --> 00:05:08.450
Hey, what did you just write down?

00:05:09.180 --> 00:05:10.830
Let's hurry home and listen to it!

00:05:11.140 --> 00:05:13.290
What should we wish for?

00:05:13.940 --> 00:05:16.790
Oh, that must be the teaser CD.

00:05:17.220 --> 00:05:18.980
Teaser CD?

00:05:18.980 --> 00:05:20.960
It's the number one rumor going around the school right now.

00:05:21.450 --> 00:05:25.380
They say if you listen to the teaser CD, you'll get whatever you want most.

00:05:25.380 --> 00:05:27.030
That's our Yaya!

00:05:28.110 --> 00:05:30.420
Just leave rumors to me!

00:05:30.420 --> 00:05:31.100
Yeah!

00:05:32.270 --> 00:05:35.770
Teaser CD... Whatever you want...

00:05:37.270 --> 00:05:39.990
But isn't that just an urban legend?

00:05:39.990 --> 00:05:41.930
I'd still kind of like to listen to it.

00:05:41.930 --> 00:05:44.800
Yeah, if you can get whatever you want...

00:05:45.120 --> 00:05:52.570
Ho-we-ver, you must get someone else to listen to it within seven days or...

00:05:52.570 --> 00:05:54.580
If you don't...

00:05:54.580 --> 00:05:57.390
An unspeakably monstrous accident will...

00:05:57.390 --> 00:05:59.270
Ah, not listening!

00:05:59.270 --> 00:06:00.420
Boo.

00:06:00.730 --> 00:06:01.900
Got you again.

00:06:01.900 --> 00:06:03.870
Amu-chi's such a scaredy-cat!

00:06:02.220 --> 00:06:03.870
Teaser CD, you say?

00:06:03.870 --> 00:06:05.210
Hey!

00:06:03.870 --> 00:06:07.720
So that is what they chose to call that black CD.

00:06:10.080 --> 00:06:10.760
Yeah.

00:06:11.910 --> 00:06:14.450
Hey now, no running away, Amu-chi!

00:06:14.450 --> 00:06:17.600
Quiet! Stop trying to tell me!

00:06:17.600 --> 00:06:19.190
Wait up!

00:06:20.330 --> 00:06:22.540
Kairi, now is your chance.

00:06:23.730 --> 00:06:24.750
Kairi!

00:06:25.360 --> 00:06:26.360
I know.

00:06:27.410 --> 00:06:30.240
...loud enough to overpower the volume. {ookina..}

00:06:30.240 --> 00:06:34.890
While the sun yet sleeps,

00:06:34.890 --> 00:06:37.290
let us begin.

00:06:37.290 --> 00:06:42.910
As the world dances with the shadows following after the light.

00:06:42.910 --> 00:06:45.550
Yes, taking your hand.

00:06:45.550 --> 00:06:53.950
So what do you desire? What do you seek?

00:06:50.640 --> 00:06:53.080
What's that? Some indie band promotion?

00:06:53.080 --> 00:06:54.180
She has a pretty voice!

00:06:53.950 --> 00:06:58.450
The brilliance collected in the palm of that hand

00:06:54.940 --> 00:06:58.600
We're doing a promotion and handing out free CDs!

00:06:58.600 --> 00:06:59.990
I want that song.

00:06:58.600 --> 00:07:04.900
will scoop it up into the tainted night sky.

00:06:59.990 --> 00:07:01.060
Me, too.

00:07:04.900 --> 00:07:10.730
Dark diamond, black diamond.

00:07:21.920 --> 00:07:23.650
I wonder where he went.

00:07:23.650 --> 00:07:25.380
What's the matter, Amu-chan?

00:07:25.380 --> 00:07:27.840
Tadase-kun just seemed kind of down today.

00:07:27.840 --> 00:07:30.500
Oh ho, so you're worried about him?

00:07:30.500 --> 00:07:32.260
That's so romantic.

00:07:32.260 --> 00:07:35.840
If you are worried about love, leave it to the Angel of Love, El!

00:07:35.840 --> 00:07:36.690
Be quiet!

00:07:36.690 --> 00:07:38.410
It's too cramped!

00:07:38.410 --> 00:07:40.400
We are over capacity!

00:07:41.830 --> 00:07:43.770
Tadase-kun!

00:07:44.670 --> 00:07:46.040
Hinamori-san.

00:07:47.020 --> 00:07:49.110
What are you doing over here?

00:07:49.960 --> 00:07:53.320
Oh, look at that. I guess I spaced out.

00:07:55.520 --> 00:08:00.290
The planetarium. Wow, what the caretaker said was true!

00:08:00.290 --> 00:08:01.170
Caretaker?

00:08:01.730 --> 00:08:06.850
Yeah. The caretaker of this planetarium is a really nice man, and he told me this:

00:08:06.850 --> 00:08:12.250
"It's a place all lost, worried children eventually end up."

00:08:14.220 --> 00:08:17.250
Tadase-kun, why are you laughing?

00:08:17.250 --> 00:08:18.260
Because...

00:08:19.600 --> 00:08:23.190
The Heart's Egg

00:08:23.980 --> 00:08:27.360
Huh? He's the Founding King?

00:08:27.900 --> 00:08:30.320
That's right. He's the founder of the Guardians.

00:08:30.320 --> 00:08:33.290
But it's also true that he's the caretaker of this place.

00:08:33.760 --> 00:08:36.410
He's not a bad person, but he does like to play tricks on people.

00:08:36.830 --> 00:08:40.270
I wouldn't pay too much attention to the things he says.

00:08:40.270 --> 00:08:42.520
Oh, I see.

00:08:42.520 --> 00:08:45.880
Then, was what he said about the artist's egg also a lie?

00:08:46.510 --> 00:08:47.750
But...

00:08:50.500 --> 00:08:55.930
"Where lost children end up," might be true.

00:08:57.160 --> 00:09:03.300
To be honest, I was tempted to listen to that teaser CD.

00:09:05.930 --> 00:09:08.160
What is it you want, Tadase-kun?

00:09:09.230 --> 00:09:11.860
To be strong, I suppose.

00:09:21.790 --> 00:09:26.420
My grandmother was a very firm and dignified person.

00:09:26.760 --> 00:09:31.070
She was a little scary, but I really loved her for that.

00:09:29.420 --> 00:09:31.920
Aspire

00:09:34.320 --> 00:09:38.480
Tadase-san, become a person of strength.

00:09:38.480 --> 00:09:42.430
Become a wonderful person, both strong and kind.

00:09:42.940 --> 00:09:44.580
Yes, Grandmother!

00:09:44.580 --> 00:09:46.050
I'll do my best!

00:09:46.900 --> 00:09:49.920
Aspire

00:09:48.110 --> 00:09:49.920
However...

00:09:50.040 --> 00:09:54.400
She became ill, and because of that is now very frail.

00:09:55.000 --> 00:09:56.360
It makes me sad.

00:09:57.700 --> 00:10:00.580
That's why I want to become a strong person.

00:10:00.580 --> 00:10:03.350
A strong, wonderful person.

00:10:03.350 --> 00:10:06.210
This time, it's my turn to protect my grandmother.

00:10:06.740 --> 00:10:09.970
And that's why, no matter how long it takes...

00:10:11.310 --> 00:10:14.330
"If I find the Embryo, I can become a strong person."

00:10:14.330 --> 00:10:20.990
That's what I thought. But it's been so long, and the Embryo still hasn't appeared before me.

00:10:22.160 --> 00:10:24.020
Is it because I'm truly weak?

00:10:25.270 --> 00:10:27.770
Am I just a fake, unreliable king?

00:10:27.770 --> 00:10:30.030
Of course not, you're...

00:10:30.030 --> 00:10:34.800
Perhaps Kiseki is really a Guardian Character who isn't suited to me.

00:10:34.800 --> 00:10:36.990
A Guardian Character who isn't suited to someone?

00:10:39.810 --> 00:10:40.940
Dia.

00:10:41.570 --> 00:10:43.080
You pitiful weakling!

00:10:43.370 --> 00:10:46.130
Sitting around worrying is proof that you are!

00:10:46.130 --> 00:10:47.660
Don't say that!

00:10:47.660 --> 00:10:51.410
Yeah, Tadase-kun isn't a weakling at all!

00:10:51.860 --> 00:10:56.370
Just because you can't become the person you want to be, you plan to rely on this teaser CD?

00:10:56.370 --> 00:10:57.930
There's a limit to my pity!

00:10:58.810 --> 00:11:01.180
I am completely disgusted by you!

00:11:22.830 --> 00:11:26.450
I wonder if Tadase-kun and Kiseki will be able to make up.

00:11:26.910 --> 00:11:29.360
It will all be okay, don't worry.

00:11:29.360 --> 00:11:35.040
Yeah! Even after an argument, we Guardian Characters are still our owner's ally.

00:11:35.040 --> 00:11:37.920
Even if the world turns upside-down.

00:11:37.920 --> 00:11:39.550
That's right!

00:11:41.130 --> 00:11:42.760
That's right!

00:11:42.760 --> 00:11:47.310
Even I, who's hiding something, am thinking of everybody and Utau-chan!

00:11:47.720 --> 00:11:52.900
Although, everyone seems to have forgotten that I'm Utau-chan's Guardian Character.

00:11:53.230 --> 00:11:56.250
Speaking of which, El sure has settled in here a little bit too-

00:11:56.250 --> 00:11:57.940
It's Dia that's the problem!

00:11:58.470 --> 00:12:02.480
If we can get Dia, who took my place, to come back to Amu-chan's side,

00:12:02.480 --> 00:12:05.910
then I think I could go back to Utau-chan!

00:12:06.910 --> 00:12:10.520
But I wonder when Dia will come back.

00:12:10.520 --> 00:12:13.000
I think it'll be around a certain time.

00:12:14.390 --> 00:12:19.540
If I can figure out who I really am, I think Dia will come back to me.

00:12:19.540 --> 00:12:21.630
Who you really are?

00:12:22.600 --> 00:12:26.760
Thanks to all of you, I've become a lot of things I want to be.

00:12:26.760 --> 00:12:32.520
It's been fun and exciting, and all the Guardians have been there for me, too.

00:12:32.950 --> 00:12:35.880
But I'm still not confident in the slightest.

00:12:35.880 --> 00:12:39.030
I can't help but wonder who I really am.

00:12:41.110 --> 00:12:44.940
So... So you see, I can understand

00:12:44.940 --> 00:12:46.030
Tadase-kun's feelings.

00:12:46.530 --> 00:12:50.630
That frustrating feeling of not being able to be who you really want to be.

00:12:54.880 --> 00:12:56.990
That little brat!

00:12:56.990 --> 00:12:58.710
She's completely in her own little world.

00:13:03.090 --> 00:13:04.680
Sheesh.

00:13:11.250 --> 00:13:13.450
Tadase, about before, I-

00:13:13.450 --> 00:13:16.240
I have homework to finish.

00:13:16.240 --> 00:13:19.060
Fine, do as you please!

00:13:23.820 --> 00:13:28.160
Aspire

00:13:24.240 --> 00:13:28.160
Become a wonderful person, both strong and kind.

00:13:29.000 --> 00:13:32.310
If I could only become stronger...

00:13:38.490 --> 00:13:39.130
This is...

00:13:39.990 --> 00:13:42.700
The teaser CD? When did it get in there?

00:13:52.100 --> 00:13:56.480
I told him to do as he pleased, but if I let him go through with it, then...

00:14:00.430 --> 00:14:05.640
Try shouting it out with a voice

00:14:02.930 --> 00:14:06.410
Tadase, what's the matter? Tadase!

00:14:06.950 --> 00:14:11.130
loud enough to overpower the volume.

00:14:10.410 --> 00:14:13.120
What is this? The egg is...

00:14:11.130 --> 00:14:15.560
While the sun yet sleeps,

00:14:15.560 --> 00:14:18.490
let us begin.

00:14:15.560 --> 00:14:18.790
Tadase! Tadase! Wait, Tadase!

00:14:18.490 --> 00:14:23.380
As the world dances with the shadows following after the light.

00:14:18.790 --> 00:14:22.380
Tadase! Tadase!

00:14:23.380 --> 00:14:26.490
Yes, taking your hand.

00:14:26.490 --> 00:14:34.730
So what do you desire? What do you seek?

00:14:34.730 --> 00:14:39.150
The brilliance collected in the palm of that hand

00:14:39.150 --> 00:14:45.750
will scoop it up into the tainted night sky.

00:14:45.750 --> 00:14:51.370
Dark diamond, black diamond.

00:14:55.040 --> 00:14:58.180
Hey, Kairi, is something on your mind?

00:15:00.950 --> 00:15:03.500
Go spread these around the school.

00:15:04.880 --> 00:15:07.610
And get the Guardians to listen to it, if you can.

00:15:07.610 --> 00:15:08.510
But that's...

00:15:09.140 --> 00:15:12.410
I suppose it doesn't matter if it's all of them.

00:15:12.410 --> 00:15:14.220
But the King's Chair's should be first.

00:15:29.640 --> 00:15:31.410
Kairi, where are you going?

00:15:34.330 --> 00:15:37.410
I wonder if Tadase-kun is feeling better.

00:15:38.780 --> 00:15:40.040
Oh, a shooting star!

00:15:41.050 --> 00:15:42.880
I wish Tadase-kun would feel better!

00:15:42.880 --> 00:15:44.840
I wish Tadase-kun would feel better!

00:15:44.020 --> 00:15:45.730
Commoners!

00:15:44.840 --> 00:15:45.730
I wish Tadase-kun would feel-

00:15:46.770 --> 00:15:48.320
The shooting star crashed down?!

00:15:48.630 --> 00:15:51.130
I'm not a shooting star! It's me!

00:15:51.550 --> 00:15:52.750
Ouch.

00:15:52.750 --> 00:15:53.960
Kiseki?

00:15:53.960 --> 00:15:56.280
Why are you inside your egg?

00:15:56.280 --> 00:15:57.760
Is this a game?

00:15:57.760 --> 00:15:59.860
Don't be fools! I can't get out!

00:15:59.860 --> 00:16:03.070
Tadase-kun listened to that suspicious CD and went off somewhere.

00:16:03.070 --> 00:16:04.060
Save him, commoners!

00:16:04.560 --> 00:16:05.710
He did?

00:16:05.710 --> 00:16:06.600
Amu-chan.

00:16:06.600 --> 00:16:07.440
Right.

00:16:10.460 --> 00:16:11.320
My heart:

00:16:11.830 --> 00:16:12.740
Unlock!

00:16:26.110 --> 00:16:28.840
Character Transformation: Amulet Heart!

00:16:30.030 --> 00:16:32.260
Wait! I'm coming, too!

00:16:32.260 --> 00:16:41.060
...will scoop it up into the tainted night sky.

00:16:35.430 --> 00:16:37.640
Where are you, Tadase-kun?

00:16:40.400 --> 00:16:43.480
Wait, why is it only kids?

00:16:41.060 --> 00:16:49.170
Dark diamond, black diamond.

00:16:46.100 --> 00:16:49.990
What is this? It's like the song called everyone here.

00:16:50.010 --> 00:16:52.820
That's it. That's the song Tadase was listening to.

00:16:56.350 --> 00:16:57.660
Everyone's eggs are...

00:17:03.480 --> 00:17:05.080
That's...

00:17:06.700 --> 00:17:07.960
King!

00:17:08.340 --> 00:17:09.650
Tadase-kun!

00:17:14.070 --> 00:17:18.180
It can't be... Tadase-kun's egg has an X on it.

00:17:18.180 --> 00:17:19.430
Just like my Dia's!

00:17:21.310 --> 00:17:22.930
What is it, Dia?

00:17:24.480 --> 00:17:25.310
Nothing.

00:17:25.730 --> 00:17:26.480
Tadase-kun!

00:17:30.660 --> 00:17:34.820
I'm weak. Forgive me, Grandmother.

00:17:34.820 --> 00:17:36.280
Am I just a failure?

00:17:37.090 --> 00:17:40.240
I can't even do such a little thing.

00:17:40.840 --> 00:17:44.250
My world is so small.

00:17:44.250 --> 00:17:45.590
Tadase-kun!

00:17:45.590 --> 00:17:46.670
Tadase-kun!

00:17:48.550 --> 00:17:50.880
Amulet Heart?

00:17:51.210 --> 00:17:53.840
You are not the least bit weak, Tadase-kun.

00:17:54.140 --> 00:17:58.600
I'm a lost child, too, who had Dia's Guardian Egg run out on her.

00:17:58.600 --> 00:18:02.940
I even considered using the teaser CD to make her come back.

00:18:02.940 --> 00:18:03.850
It's totally normal!

00:18:04.490 --> 00:18:06.560
Please remember...

00:18:06.560 --> 00:18:08.210
Remember the day Kiseki was born!

00:18:09.360 --> 00:18:12.930
The day Kiseki was born...

00:18:18.810 --> 00:18:20.030
Don't cry, Tadase.

00:18:21.230 --> 00:18:26.540
I'm here with you, so you should just do whatever you can do.

00:18:27.440 --> 00:18:29.540
What I can do?

00:18:55.200 --> 00:18:58.380
The best thing about you, Tadase, is your kindness.

00:18:58.380 --> 00:19:00.630
It's because of that kindness that you can protect everyone.

00:19:00.630 --> 00:19:03.570
That's why you're the King's Chair, Tadase!

00:19:04.710 --> 00:19:07.480
Believe in your true self!

00:19:07.480 --> 00:19:09.730
Believe in your kind self!

00:19:11.060 --> 00:19:11.880
Kiseki!

00:19:14.510 --> 00:19:15.460
Tadase!

00:19:19.910 --> 00:19:21.230
My heart:

00:19:21.230 --> 00:19:22.680
Unlock!

00:19:36.840 --> 00:19:39.820
Character Transformation: Platinum Royal!

00:19:41.920 --> 00:19:43.800
Thank you, Hinamori-san.

00:19:43.800 --> 00:19:44.700
I'm okay now.

00:19:45.290 --> 00:19:46.570
Tadase-kun!

00:19:53.920 --> 00:19:54.970
Hinamori-san!

00:19:54.970 --> 00:19:55.770
Right!

00:19:56.220 --> 00:19:57.560
Heart Rod!

00:20:04.650 --> 00:20:08.410
Spiral Heart Special!

00:20:12.840 --> 00:20:15.080
White Decoration!

00:20:25.820 --> 00:20:27.670
Now, Hinamori-san!

00:20:27.670 --> 00:20:28.450
Okay!

00:20:30.160 --> 00:20:31.710
Negative Heart:

00:20:33.440 --> 00:20:34.650
Lock On!

00:20:37.920 --> 00:20:39.840
Open Heart!

00:20:47.450 --> 00:20:48.990
The X's are gone!

00:20:48.990 --> 00:20:51.390
Their combined power is amazing!

00:20:56.750 --> 00:20:58.560
A completely white egg?

00:21:02.800 --> 00:21:04.160
It flew away.

00:21:05.100 --> 00:21:06.790
I wonder what it was.

00:21:10.660 --> 00:21:11.800
Kiseki!

00:21:11.800 --> 00:21:17.040
I've said it before, haven't I? If you can't become a kind and gentle king, you can't rule the world.

00:21:17.420 --> 00:21:21.670
Right now, you should just keep working hard, Tadase.

00:21:21.670 --> 00:21:25.200
I'm sure that your grandmother would praise you for it.

00:21:25.200 --> 00:21:26.060
Yeah.

00:21:40.350 --> 00:21:41.790
What a relief.

00:21:41.790 --> 00:21:42.680
Yeah.

00:21:42.680 --> 00:21:45.070
All right, let's all go home.

00:21:45.070 --> 00:21:46.240
Yeah!

00:21:52.160 --> 00:21:54.250
Quite impressive of them to get in our way.

00:21:54.840 --> 00:21:56.620
But now we have proof.

00:21:57.700 --> 00:22:03.550
The CD we recorded after you'd changed with Dia has a significantly enhanced egg collection rate.

00:22:04.540 --> 00:22:07.490
The mysterious indie band, Black Diamonds...

00:22:07.490 --> 00:22:09.190
Their true identity is...

00:22:10.430 --> 00:22:14.840
We're finally putting the plan into action, Utau.

00:22:38.120 --> 00:22:41.130
You can't think that there's {kotaenante...}

00:22:41.130 --> 00:22:44.510
an answer out there somewhere, you see. {arutte...}

00:22:45.320 --> 00:22:50.810
Because the only place you'll find it is inside you. {kotaenante...}

00:22:50.810 --> 00:22:53.050
Ain't that cool? {kakkoii...}

00:22:53.770 --> 00:22:58.000
The fact is, all you're truly feeling... {arinomama...}

00:22:58.000 --> 00:23:00.330
Yup, it's love! {yappa...}

00:23:00.990 --> 00:23:05.890
And right now, all those feelings are welling up. {ima no mama...}

00:23:05.890 --> 00:23:09.660
So head toward the sun, give it everything you've got. {sei ippai...}

00:23:09.660 --> 00:23:13.270
Try bustin' through. {butsukete...}

00:23:13.270 --> 00:23:16.640
Face forward, raise your head up high. {maemuite...}

00:23:16.640 --> 00:23:20.550
There's no time to cry. {naiteru...}

00:23:20.550 --> 00:23:23.800
A passionate kiss! This "youthful" kiss! {jounetsu...}

00:23:23.800 --> 00:23:27.800
I love you when you're trying your best, like now.  {ima ganbatteru...}

00:23:27.800 --> 00:23:31.050
The best kiss! This "all-out" kiss! {saiko no...}

00:23:31.050 --> 00:23:35.030
I want to show you these feelings that fill my heart. {mune ippai...}

00:23:35.030 --> 00:23:39.730
I L-O-V-E Y-O-U.

00:23:46.200 --> 00:23:48.330
Today, I'm number one!

00:23:48.330 --> 00:23:49.480
Yay!

00:23:50.440 --> 00:23:52.500
Amu-chan, we've got big trouble!

00:23:52.500 --> 00:23:53.320
What's the matter?

00:23:53.320 --> 00:23:55.820
Rima might quit being a Guardian!

00:23:55.820 --> 00:23:57.910
Huh? Why? What should I do?

00:23:57.910 --> 00:23:59.120
We have to stop her somehow!

00:23:59.120 --> 00:24:00.870
Guys, what should we do?

00:24:00.870 --> 00:24:04.580
Use a lot of cookies, and the cocoa Rima likes...

00:24:04.580 --> 00:24:08.040
I think you should use a lot of gag manga, too.

00:24:08.040 --> 00:24:10.330
You expect that to stop her?

00:24:10.330 --> 00:24:11.460
Next time on Shugo Chara:

00:24:11.460 --> 00:24:13.110
Rima! Unlock your Heart!

00:24:13.110 --> 00:24:15.160
I'm worried about the teaser CD.

00:24:15.160 --> 00:24:16.970
And I'm worried about Rima, too.

00:24:16.970 --> 00:24:20.060
Oh dear, what shall we do?
